1957 0 obj
  << /ActualText (It might not look like it at first glance\054 but classic NES sprites are actually huge\041 This single piece contains around 1250 beads per layer \0502500 beads total\051\024which is equivalent to weaving a massive 30\32784 bead bracelet\056 Crafting the entire thing bead\055by\055bead using square stitch from scratch can feel intimidating\056\nTo save time and sanity\054 my approach is to do the bulk of the work on a loom\054 as shown in the photo\056 For this specific Shredder design\054 the loom work covers exactly 90\045 of the project\056 Once the loom phase is finished\054 you will only need to attach the sword\054 the boots\054 and a few extra beads on the sides that didn\047t fit into the main body\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 1958 0 R
     /Pg 1181 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

1958 0 obj
  << /K [ 1957 0 R ]
     /P 1975 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 1181 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

