1965 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Mind the orientation when you fold the piece\056 The empty fist must be on the right side when looking directly at Shredder \050that\031s his left hand\051\056\nPull down all the jellyfish strings pair by pair\056 Note that this whole 2\055layer folding trick only works if the top half is oval or circular\054 which is exactly what we have here\056\nYou\031ll have to hide all these tails between the rows or inside the beads\056 Check out this YouTube video on how to do so\072  )
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 1968 0 R
     /Pg 1181 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

